<title>UK: British output prices rise 0.4 pct in September.</title>
<headline>British output prices rise 0.4 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British output prices rose 0.4 percent in September after remaining flat in August, official figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Output prices rose 2.2 percent in September on a year-on-year basis after a 2.0 percent increase in August. The figures were in line with analysts' projections.</p>
</text>
